    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "LEGO almost went broke, while kids never stopped loving the brick.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 2.58,
        "window": 3.23,
        "fill": 0.799
      },
      {
        "scene": "loss",
        "text": "In one year, the company behind it lost about DKK 1.4B. So where did the money go?",
        "start": 3.53,
        "seconds": 4.86,
        "window": 5.5,
        "fill": 0.884
      },
      {
        "scene": "parks",
        "text": "Not into the brick. LEGO had poured itself into theme parks, like this one in its home town, Billund.",
        "start": 9.03,
        "seconds": 4.34,
        "window": 5.0,
        "fill": 0.868
      },
      {
        "scene": "parts",
        "text": "And its boxes had filled up with new, one-off pieces, far too many to make cheaply. So what could save it?",
        "start": 14.03,
        "seconds": 4.48,
        "window": 5.1,
        "fill": 0.878
      },
      {
        "scene": "boss",
        "text": "Then a young new boss, Jørgen Vig Knudstorp, took LEGO back to the brick, and sold control of the parks.",
        "start": 19.13,
        "seconds": 4.39,
        "window": 5.07,
        "fill": 0.866
      },
      {
        "scene": "shops",
        "text": "Today LEGO shops run from Billund to London to Singapore.",
        "start": 24.2,
        "seconds": 2.23,
        "window": 2.9,
        "fill": 0.769
      },
      {
        "scene": "sales",
        "text": "Last year, it sold DKK 83.5B worth of toys, 12% more than the year before.",
        "start": 27.1,
        "seconds": 5.17,
        "window": 5.83,
        "fill": 0.887
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "And it kept DKK 16.7B of that for itself, from the same plastic brick it nearly gave up on.",
        "start": 32.93,
        "seconds": 5.33,
        "window": 5.97,
        "fill": 0.893
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "Brick or theme park: which would you have kept? Because not long ago,",
        "start": 38.9,
        "seconds": 2.75,
        "window": 3.4,
        "fill": 0.809
      }
    ]
  },
